  "qid": "29",
  "tip": "<p>Map requirements to native strengths. When you see <i>strong consistency</i> with <i>horizontally scalable writes</i> for a relational workload, choose Spanner. Remember that read replicas do not increase write capacity and that sharding or NoSQL options can compromise transactional guarantees.</p>",
